	(text "DisplayModule DMKDI0400S0CA (4.0\" 720x720, ST7703, 4-lane DSI) - 30-pin 0.5 mm FPC"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 25.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.5 2.5)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "22e2bd66-aee6-45b3-8281-db75c9b41f42")
	)
	(text "Panel spec V1.0.0 (2025) s.4.1. DSI1 4 lanes (JP2.75-96). RESET at IOVCC 1.8 V (GPIO3_A4, JP3.62). VCI 3.3 V via\nTPS22919 on LCD_PWREN (GPIO4_A7, JP1.97). TE unused. Double-sided-contact connector: which face is up is fixed at placement."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 30.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "184f690c-56b7-405c-83f8-353556d13699")
	)
	(text "Backlight: TPS61169 LED boost, 12 LEDs 18.6 V / 40 mA (panel spec s.6.3)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 213.36 25.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.5 2.5)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "453e5b0b-33e0-4704-aa78-0beda5a64f0c")
	)
	(text "TI SNVSA40B Fig. 7-1: L 4.7 uH, COUT 1 uF 50 V, Schottky 40 V. RSET = 204 mV / 40 mA = 5.1 Ohm. PWM dimming on CTRL\n(5-100 kHz, PWM13_M1 = GPIO4_B6, JP1.95). OVP 38 V. Panel B/L circuit: 2 parallel strings of 6 LEDs, 18.6 +-0.3 V,\n40 mA total."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 213.36 30.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "0061fb46-d675-4ca1-be67-cbb95154a779")
	)
	(text "Capacitive touch (GT911 on the panel CTP tail, 8-pin 0.5 mm) on I2C6_M3 (JP1.80 / JP1.82, 3.3 V)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 134.62 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.5 2.5)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a5b9e6e2-35d6-4504-87c8-3c883bf9660a")
	)
	(text "Panel spec s.4.2. INT also selects the GT911 address at reset (0x5D / 0x14). I2C6 is shared with the\nkeyboard (0x1F) and the reserved digitizer; pull-ups here."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 139.7 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "0f93fb3c-a996-4b9f-852a-5fd007af835f")
	)
	(text "Reserved digitizer port (decision Q1): hub port 4 USB, I2C6, INT, RST, 3.3 V - 12-pin 0.5 mm FFC"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 243.84 134.62 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.5 2.5)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "8709008c-d794-4cd8-be6c-b85af21c9aca")
	)
	(text "Pinout mirrors the keyboard FFC (USB pair between ground pins). 3.3 V switched by hub PRTPWR4 (TPS22919)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 243.84 139.7 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7ae32208-8269-41d3-bd05-b6b2f028d1f8")
	)
	(text "CAM-A (rear): 4-lane CSI (MIPI_CSI0 D-PHY, JP2 odd pins) - Hirose FH35C-31S, Radxa 31-pin camera standard"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 198.12 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.5 2.5)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c4209334-2fa8-42ff-93d0-67f8d6b313ae")
	)
	(text "Rear camera: Radxa Camera 13M 214 (Sony IMX214 13 MP, autofocus DW9714, HDR), Radxa 31p 0.3 mm opposite-side cable.\nOrange Pi CM5: I2C3_M1 (GPIO3_B7 / C0, JP3.34 / 72), MCLK MIPI_CAMERA1_CLK_M1 (GPIO3_A6, JP3.52), PDN GPIO3_C5,\nRST GPIO3_C6, all 1.8 V; device tree needs a custom overlay. I2C 2.2k pull-ups to 1.8 V. 3.3 V via 120R bead, 5 V via 0 Ohm."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 203.2 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "668cfdb9-1ed4-471c-850a-ac305a101620")
	)
	(text "CAM-B (front): 2-lane CSI (MIPI_DPHY0_RX = DC-PHY0 in D-PHY mode, JP2 even pins) - Hirose FH35C-31S"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 264.16 198.12 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.5 2.5)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "326019c9-9bbc-4fee-905a-54a9c16238db")
	)
	(text "Front camera: Radxa Camera 8M 219 (Sony IMX219 8 MP) through Radxa 31-pin 0.3 mm -> 15-pin 1.0 mm same-side cable\n(as on ROCK 5A/5B/5C). Lanes 0/1 + CLK only; pins 2/3, 5/6, 8/9, 22, 26, 30/31 open. I2C2_M4 (GPIO1_A0 / A1,\nJP2.2 / 4) at 3.3 V with 2.2k pull-ups here. PDN0 (23) = GPIO3_C4, RESET (27) = GPIO3_A1, MCLK (20) = GPIO3_A7, 1.8 V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 264.16 203.2 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "76d4ca31-4466-4049-9ec8-835217803679")
	)
